cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fastPISA"
abstract: >-
  Local Python reproduction of the CCP4/PDBe PISA interface analysis,
  numerically calibrated against the original engine, with crystal
  symmetry-mate enumeration, assembly prediction and a COCOMAPS 2.0
  residue-residue contact-map mode. Parses PDB and mmCIF (AlphaFold-predicted
  complexes included), finds biomolecular interfaces, and emits
  PDBe-PISA-shaped JSON.
keywords:
  - PISA
  - protein interfaces
  - structural biology
  - crystal packing
  - biological assembly
  - contact maps
  - COCOMAPS
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/dzyla/fastPISA"
authors:
  - family-names: "Zyla"
    given-names: "Dawid"
version: "0.5.0"
date-released: "2026-10-04"
references:
